WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.500
In Library, choose Add game. Search for a title.

00:02.500 --> 00:05.000
Select the matching game from the results.

00:05.000 --> 00:07.500
Check that you selected the right game.

00:07.500 --> 00:10.000
Choose your platform and status. Rating is optional.

00:10.000 --> 00:12.500
Leave notes empty if you like, then choose Add game.

00:12.500 --> 00:15.000
Your game is now in your library.
